# FV Multimarcas — polish is in scope

This repo is a client-facing proposal site. When the **ponytail** skill or “minimal change” instincts apply, treat the following as **required deliverables**, not optional flourishes to delete:

- Hero brand red gradient, featured vehicle carousel (Embla/shadcn), and accessible search on the hero
- Vehicle preview modal (Dialog/Drawer), gallery interactions, and `?veiculo=` deep link behavior
- React Bits motion where already used (SplitText, CountUp, FadeContent, SpotlightCard, TiltedCard) and WCAG-conscious contrast
- shadcn/ui patterns already adopted for the redesign

Ponytail’s “never cut what the user asked for” applies to Tiago’s visual and interaction requirements. Simplify only unrelated or unrequested code.

## Fidelity to the client’s live site

Do **not** add pages, simulators, menus, or CTAs that are absent from the current FV site at https://fvmultimarcas.com.br. Use the live site as the scope boundary: improve layout, acessibilidade e navegação sobre **o mesmo conteúdo e mesmas jornadas** — não inventar funcionalidades (ex.: simulador de parcelas, rota dedicada de financiamento).
